Propose_Governor_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when a target is the company Safe
│   └── it should revert with TargetNotAllowed
├── when a target is not in the allowed list
│   ├── given the target is the Zodiac Roles modifier
│   │   └── it should revert with TargetNotAllowed
│   └── given the target is any other address
│       └── it should revert with TargetNotAllowed
├── when a value is not zero
│   └── it should revert with ValueNotAllowed
├── when the proposer's votes are below the threshold
│   └── it should revert with the Governor's threshold error
└── when every target is allowed and the proposer has enough votes
    ├── it should snapshot votes at the proposal start
    ├── it should raise pendingUntil to the proposal's snapshot
    ├── given an earlier proposal's snapshot is later
    │   └── it should keep pendingUntil at the later snapshot
    └── it should emit ProposalCreated
